{"server":"cn","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_02_end","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_02","title":"察言观色","storyCode":"GT-2","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"a06b457a9482d457c7705c0329fa0c0b812d0bdd78e47d39a905c95642e3da5f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶，这些赏金猎人真是缠人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"呀！虫子！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"好恶心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呃，黏黏糊糊的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"快把她们包围起来！别让她们又逃了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"打不过那个小个子没所谓！缠住他，然后把那个村长小姑娘抓回来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可萝尔！别离开我身边！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"你们两个，捂住耳朵！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？你是谁？哪冒出来的大胖子啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"噗啊啊啊啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，胖子？我只是壮而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"那是什么炸弹爆炸了吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"震撼弹而已，声音很大，没杀伤力的！不过用来驱散这些虫子还有野兽都很有效！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"趁虫子和那些家伙都被爆炸吓跑，快走！先转移到安全的地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可萝尔！这次可别再是小阁楼什么的了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"那，来这边！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"narration","text":"晴 \\ 能见度 14公里\n村外树林"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"这片树林非常偏僻，只有我和我小时候的玩伴知道这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"等下，可萝尔，先别放松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"锯子，弹药，爆破物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"我把这些全放在地上了。这样可以好好谈谈宝藏了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是个赏金猎人，但我没有刚才那些家伙那么贪心。刚才那些充其量只是来跑腿的杂鱼，也不够聪明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"比起冒着风险抢夺这位村长姑娘，不如主动与你们合作来的更有效率。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你刚才帮了我们，但现在不是谈宝藏的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是赏金猎人，不是干这行的，我看得出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"而我，对这行当了如指掌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"滴水村周遭的赏金猎人情况，你也很清楚吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"托伦团、佛罗茨团、卢布林团、瓦各斯克团——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的赏金猎人都在整个区域进行地毯式搜索，已经好几天了。说实话，宝藏被他们找到也只是时间问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"无论哪个赏金猎人找到宝藏，不同派系的赏金猎人绝对会为了争夺宝藏，在这片地区争得头破血流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"那时滴水村不但什么好处都拿不到，说不定还会被摧毁得一干二净，你们明白得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你能为我们提供些什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"野外向导，猎人经验，暗号识别，陷阱拆解，以及多一个的战力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"不管哪个，都是你们现在急缺的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"那，请问我该怎么称呼你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我大鲍勃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，请你稍等，我需要和村长商量一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"这个位置，大鲍勃不会听到我们的谈话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我信不过一个赏金猎人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"把我们骗进陷阱，或者和其他赏金猎人串通，这些都是我们没法承受的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可萝尔，你见过这位大鲍勃吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是没有......每个破坏过村庄，甚至来过的赏金猎人，他们的样子，我都记得清清楚楚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"和他合作，肯定会有风险的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来的情况会随时间的推移变得更加复杂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"为了早点找到宝藏，我们也许必须借用他的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"那格拉尼，你说的那个同事也能帮上忙吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"不太好说。她不是那么好相处的人，而且她同样也是个赏金猎人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可以的话，我想先搞清楚情况，再去找她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"让我想想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能告诉他埋藏宝藏的地方。我可以分几次告诉他大概的方向，就像在牧兽的脑袋前面挂上粮食一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"这样行吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，这样做是对的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"我会盯紧他的。情况不对的话，我会立刻把你送出森林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可萝尔，你的安全，交给我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"如何？先给我一个方向吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"我们需要一条能够迅速前往塔拉特山的道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"想要前往塔拉特山，就必须穿过北方这片森林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"那片森林，也是赏金猎人互相争夺的战场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"想必已经有很多赏金猎人埋伏在那里了。但是我会带你们从安全的路过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"鲍勃大叔，想要合作的话，我们是有条件的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，这是我们接下来要谈的重点，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"你只要先告诉我，几几分成。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"我不渴！不用给我水！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好，我说上尉，那两个小孩我们还找不找了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能不找？我们是为了什么才走到今天的？忘了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"这边离城市远得很，通讯信号也和没有一样，虽然支援会来得晚，但是这对其他团也一样的。这可是大好的机会！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赏金猎人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"可那个怪物也往那个方向去了，我们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"怕什么？虽然那家伙是有点厉害，但是别忘了那边可是我们的地盘。那么多陷阱，有她好受的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"宝藏，我们要拿！怪物，我们也要狩猎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"老子全都要！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["格拉尼"]}]}
